바다를 조망할 수 있어 침대에 누워서 일출을 감상할 수 있다.","여름철에는 카라반 앞에 위치한 해변에서 해수욕을 즐길 수 있으며, 수영장과 트램펄린도 운영한다.","미국형 카라반은 실내 2,3면이 확장되는 가변형으로 침실과 거실 공간을 넓게 사용할 수 있다.","한국형 카라반은 지상과 펜션 옥상에 위치하여 동해 일출을 한눈에 볼 수 있다.","더불어 원룸형과 투룸형의 펜션도 운영한다.","- 입실 14:00"]}],"sns_images":[{"thumb":"https://search2.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/FLh3zMVwI9S","img":"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNjA2MDlfMTI4/MDAxNzgwOTM2NTE4Njg5.dD3Og_JYAk-5UCfQhgLoVfjjOZFcy_XKpmijSOH7OLAg.BNgVif7bt2G3DIcY4WkbcnFMbTAQIajmj-3E2dEj8zsg.JPEG/blog_img_20ed2524.jpg?type=w773","url":"https://blog.naver.com/spotnote2006/224310073685","src":"네이버블로그","w":640,"h":640,"date":"2026-06-09"},{"thumb":"https://search4.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/CnVCP64tWEi","img":"https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1457/6508RfLxRudkG9bs8D1hFlwr.jpg","url":"https://blogsailing.com/2995","src":"티스토리","w":2400,"h":1600,"date":"2023-02-28"},{"thumb":"https://search1.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/8cl5Wp4JJNX","img":"https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/33/3522633_image2_1.jpg","url":"https://leports.sailing-blog.click/4446","src":"티스토리","w":940,"h":705,"date":"2025-11-24"},{"thumb":"https://search1.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/97pk2k0vhN6","img":"https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/78/2763078_image2_1.JPG","url":"https://leports.sailing-blog.click/1639","src":"티스토리","w":940,"h":626,"date":"2023-10-13"},{"thumb":"https://search3.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/LuSRlL5bhoi","img":"https://simg.pstatic.net/static.map/v2/map/staticmap.bin?caller=smarteditor&markers=color%3A0x11cc73%7Ctype%3Ad%7CviewSizeRatio%3A0.7%7Cpos%3A129.5244509%2035.8576378%7Csize%3Amid&w=700&h=315&scale=2&dataversion=178.00","url":"https://blog.naver.com/spotnote2006/224310073685","src":"네이버블로그","w":1400,"h":630,"date":"2026-06-09"},{"thumb":"https://search4.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/24pKOBawL09","img":"https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/57/2840957_image2_1.jpg","url":"https://leports.sailing-blog.click/4446","src":"티스토리","w":750,"h":422,"date":"202